{
  "name": "Day 45 Solution: AI Agent Learning",
  "description": "Learning agent system that reads real learning history from Airtable, computes a real improvement delta against that history (no random numbers), asks an LLM to propose an adaptive behavior update, then appends this run back to Airtable for the next run to learn from.",
  "tags": [
    "week-07",
    "ai-agents",
    "day-45",
    "learning",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-overview",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 45 Solution: AI Agent Learning\n\nReads the last 5 logged runs from Airtable (real learning history), computes a real improvement delta between this run's metrics and the historical average, asks an LLM to propose one concrete adaptive behavior change, then appends this run's metrics and adaptation back to Airtable so the next run has one more data point.\n\n**What changed from the audited version:** the three fake \"reinforcement/supervised/unsupervised learning\" HTTP calls to `api.learning-service.com` and the two fake \"send/log\" calls are gone, replaced with a real Airtable read, a real Airtable append, and the `Math.random()` improvement score replaced with a real arithmetic delta computed from that history.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Airtable Personal Access Token (both airtable nodes — set your own base/table); OpenAI API key (adaptation node).\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_45_AI_Agent_Learning.md for the full lesson this solves.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "learning-agent-system",
      "name": "Learning Agent System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "learning-agent",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "initialize-learning-system",
      "name": "Initialize Learning System",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_session_id",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyyMMddHHmmss') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_type",
              "value": "adaptive"
            },
            {
              "name": "start_time",
              "value": "={{ $now }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_algorithms",
              "value": "={{ ['reinforcement', 'supervised', 'unsupervised'] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "process-learning-data",
      "name": "Process Learning Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "training_data",
              "value": "={{ $json.training_data || 'Sample training data for learning' }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "performance_metrics",
              "value": "={{ $json.metrics || { 'accuracy': 75, 'efficiency': 80, 'satisfaction': 4.0 } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_objectives",
              "value": "={{ $json.objectives || ['improve_accuracy', 'increase_efficiency', 'enhance_satisfaction'] }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "read-learning-history",
      "name": "Read Learning History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "list",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "learning_history",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 5,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-learning-services",
      "name": "Real History Read Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable history\n\nThis node replaces the three fake \"reinforcement/supervised/unsupervised learning\" calls to `api.learning-service.com`. It actually reads the last 5 logged runs from Airtable — this is the agent's real learning history.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "consolidate-learning-history",
      "name": "Consolidate Learning History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const history = $input.all().map(item => item.json);\nreturn [{ json: { history } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "compute-improvement",
      "name": "Compute Improvement",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "history_count",
              "value": "={{ $json.history.length }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "avg_historical_accuracy",
              "value": "={{ $json.history.length ? $json.history.reduce((sum, item) => sum + (item.accuracy || 0), 0) / $json.history.length : $('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics.accuracy }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "current_accuracy",
              "value": "={{ $('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics.accuracy }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "learning_improvement",
              "value": "={{ Math.round(($('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics.accuracy - ($json.history.length ? $json.history.reduce((sum, item) => sum + (item.accuracy || 0), 0) / $json.history.length : $('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics.accuracy)) * 100) / 100 }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "trend_direction",
              "value": "={{ $json.learning_improvement > 0 ? 'improving' : ($json.learning_improvement < 0 ? 'declining' : 'flat') }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adaptive-behavior-update",
      "name": "Adaptive Behavior Update",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an AI learning system that analyzes real performance history and generates one concrete, actionable adaptive behavior update for the next run. Do not give generic advice like 'keep improving' — name a specific change."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Training data: ' + $('Process Learning Data').item.json.training_data + '\\n\\nCurrent metrics: ' + JSON.stringify($('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics) + '\\n\\nHistorical runs used for comparison: ' + $json.history_count + '\\n\\nAverage historical accuracy: ' + $json.avg_historical_accuracy + '\\n\\nComputed improvement delta: ' + $json.learning_improvement + ' (' + $json.trend_direction + ')\\n\\nPropose one specific, testable behavior change for the next run and justify it using these real numbers.' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 500
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-learning-report",
      "name": "Generate Learning Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1680,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_report",
              "value": "={{ { \"learning_session_id\": $('Initialize Learning System').item.json.learning_session_id, \"learning_type\": $('Initialize Learning System').item.json.learning_type, \"start_time\": $('Initialize Learning System').item.json.start_time, \"training_data\": $('Process Learning Data').item.json.training_data, \"performance_metrics\": $('Process Learning Data').item.json.performance_metrics, \"learning_objectives\": $('Process Learning Data').item.json.learning_objectives, \"history_count\": $('Compute Improvement').item.json.history_count, \"avg_historical_accuracy\": $('Compute Improvement').item.json.avg_historical_accuracy, \"learning_improvement\": $('Compute Improvement').item.json.learning_improvement, \"trend_direction\": $('Compute Improvement').item.json.trend_direction, \"adaptive_updates\": $json.message.content, \"processing_time\": $now.diff($('Initialize Learning System').item.json.start_time, 'milliseconds'), \"completed_at\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "success_message",
              "value": "✅ AI agent learning processing completed successfully"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "append-learning-history-to-airtable",
      "name": "Append Learning History to Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "learning_history",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "learning_session_id": "={{ $json.learning_report.learning_session_id }}",
            "accuracy": "={{ $json.learning_report.performance_metrics.accuracy }}",
            "efficiency": "={{ $json.learning_report.performance_metrics.efficiency }}",
            "learning_improvement": "={{ $json.learning_report.learning_improvement }}",
            "trend_direction": "={{ $json.learning_report.trend_direction }}",
            "adaptive_updates": "={{ $json.learning_report.adaptive_updates }}",
            "logged_at": "={{ $json.learning_report.completed_at }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-send-log",
      "name": "Real Append Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ✅ Real, testable append\n\nThis node replaces the fake \"Send Learning Results\" and \"Log Learning Activity\" calls to `api.learning-service.com`. It actually writes this run's metrics and adaptation back to Airtable so the next run's history read includes it.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "handle-learning-error",
      "name": "Handle Learning Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "learning_error",
              "value": "={{ { \"error_type\": \"learning_failed\", \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"message\": \"AI agent learning failed\", \"timestamp\": $now } }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "error_response",
              "value": "={{ { \"status\": \"error\", \"learning_session_id\": $json.learning_session_id, \"message\": \"AI agent learning workflow error\" } }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Learning Agent System": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Initialize Learning System",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Initialize Learning System": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Process Learning Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Handle Learning Error",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Process Learning Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Learning History",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Learning History": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Consolidate Learning History",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Consolidate Learning History": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Compute Improvement",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Compute Improvement": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Adaptive Behavior Update",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Adaptive Behavior Update": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Learning Report",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Learning Report": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Append Learning History to Airtable",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "2",
  "id": "day_45_solution"
}
